<title>FRANCE: Sodexho H1 sales rise 12.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Sodexho H1 sales rise 12.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					14,082    vs   12,472</p>
<p>     - Q2					    6,791    vs    6,203</p>
<p>NOTE - Sodexho Alliance issued its September-February first-half results in the official bulletin BALO. It said sales rose 12.9 percent -- 4.5 percent from internal growth, 1.2 percent from changes in structure and 7.2 percent from the positive impact of foreign exchange movements.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
